    "detailed_description": "In the depths of a forgotten void, 9 men get mad at eachother. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n-----------------------------------<br />\r\n&quot;Monculi&quot; is a 3D Arcade Platform fighter with a 2D artstyle. After the previous round's winner picks the stage every player runs, jumps, and punches until only one remains. After a round ends the losers get to select a card that will grant them upgrades or powerful abilities. Gameplay only ends when you get bored and turn it off, so enjoy the infinite potential that awaits you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCurrently only available on windows. Local multiplayer only (hopefully not for long ;) ).",
